            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازیگرها روی صحنه آمدند. bâzigarhâ ru-ye sahne âmadand. The actors came on stage."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a scene in a film or a play. Plural sahnehâ."
